<title>JAPAN: S'tomo Metal Min files Y100 bln shelf registration.</title>
<headline>S'tomo Metal Min files Y100 bln shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Metal Mining Co Ltd has filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 100 billion yen worth of corporate bonds, effective for two years from May 20, the ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
